enkins CI/CD pipelines, enabling continuous testing on every pull request.\r\n\r\nAuthored 150+ automated regression test scripts, cutting testing execution time from 3 days to 4 hours.\r\n\r\nConducted daily API automation testing using Python requests library to validate backend microservices.\r\n\r\nSoftware Test Engineer | DataStream Systems \u2014 Chicago, IL | Jun 2021 \u2013 Feb 2023\r\n\r\nDesigned and executed manual and automated test cases for enterprise data analytics software.\r\n\r\nWorked directly with developers in 2-week Agile sprints to review user stories and accept criteria.\r\n\r\nMaintained SQL queries for backend data validation and test data preparation.\r\n\r\nEDUCATION\r\n\r\nB.S. in Software Engineering \u2014 Illinois Institute of Technology, 2017 \u2013 2021", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1962, "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}]}, "6eaba9e35e1b1a3a4c1838462b2b3cc53bd377e12a6af60db26beca41c300254": {"nodes": [{"__data__": {"id_": "5aa512f3-d295-4166-af94-46e35d64f1e0", "embedding": [0.008026123046875, -0.0228729248046875, 0.032440185546875, -0.02630615234375, -0.0016422271728515625, -0.03240966796875, -0.038787841796875, 0.039794921875, -0.0011110305786132812, 0.046539306640625, 0.041961669921875, -0.038726806640625, -0.024505615234375, 0.01554107666015625, 0.07073974609375, 0.063720703125, -0.0045623779296875, -0.006725311279296875, -0.041534423828125, 0.032989501953125, 0.06427001953125, 0.0038089752197265625, 0.0263671875, -0.003021240234375, 0.0232696533203125, -0.064453125, -0.01111602783203125, 0.026123046875, -0.036376953125, -0.038848876953125, 0.042236328125, -0.031646728515625, -0.03070068359375, -0.0117950439453125, 0.0058441162109375, 0.0146942138671875, 0.01453399658203125, -0.020751953125, 0.0004057884216308594, -0.009185791015625, -0.00032329559326171875, -0.06640625, 0.026123046875, 0