ream Systems (Jun 2021 \u2013 Feb 2023):\n    - Designed and executed both manual and automated test cases for data analytics software.\n    - Collaborated with developers in Agile sprints to refine user stories and acceptance criteria.\n    - Managed SQL queries for backend validation and test data preparation.\n\n- **Education:** \n  - B.S. in Software Engineering from Illinois Institute of Technology (2017 \u2013 2021)", "excerpt_keywords": "Keywords: QA Automation, Python, Selenium, CI/CD, Test Framework"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "b0e67b76-04ea-4443-bf04-55d397093332", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "D:\\LLM_Learning\\llamaindex_basics\\Files\\Patel_Priya.md", "file_name": "Patel_Priya.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 1974, "creation_date": "2026-09-08", "last_modified_date": "2026-09-08"}, "hash": "e0f1e80dfabedba0e5d499a509efad414719d7cb55bbd794d73a4a2eb1d662dd", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Mid-Level QA Automation Engineer\r\nPRIYA PATEL\r\n\r\nQA Automation Engineer (Python & Selenium)\r\n\r\nEmail: priya.patel@email.com | Phone: +1 (555) 014-9921 | Location: Chicago, IL\r\n\r\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/priya-patel-qa | Portfolio: priyapatel-qa.dev\r\n\r\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\r\n\r\nQuality Assurance Engineer with 4+ years of experience specializing in test automation for web applications and REST APIs. Proficient in Python, Selenium WebDriver, pytest, and CI/CD pipeline integration. Proven track record of reducing manual regression test execution time by 60% through robust test framework development.\r\n\r\nTECHNICAL SKILLS\r\n\r\nAutomation: Python, Selenium WebDriver, pytest, Requests, Playwright\r\n\r\nAPI Testing: Postman, REST Assured, Swagger/OpenAPI\r\n\r\nCI/CD & DevOps: Jenkins, Git, GitHub Actions, Docker\r\n\r\nPerformance Testing: JMeter (Basic)\r\n\r\nDatabases: PostgreSQL, MySQL\r\n\r\nProcesses: Agile/Scrum, CI/CD Integration, BDD (Behave)\r\n\r\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\nQA Automation Engineer | FinTech Innovations \u2014 Chicago, IL | Mar 2023 \u2013 Present\r\n\r\nBuilt and maintained an end-to-end Python + Selenium + pytest test automation framework for a high-traffic web payment portal.\r\n\r\nIntegrated automated test suites into Jenkins CI/CD pipelines, enabling continuous testing on every pull request.\r\n\r\nAuthored 150+ automated regression test scripts, cutting testing execution time from 3 days to 4 hours.\r\n\r\nConducted daily API automation testing using Python requests library to validate backend microservices.\r\n\r\nSoftware Test Engineer | DataStream Systems \u2014 Chicago, IL | Jun 2021 \u2013 Feb 2023\r\n\r\nDesigned and executed manual and automated test cases for enterprise data analytics software.\r\n\r\nWorked directly with developers in 2-week Agile sprints to review user stories and accept criteria.\r\n\r\nMaintained SQL queries for backend data validation and test data preparation.\r\n\r\nEDUCATION\r\n\r\nB.S. in Software Engineering \u2014 Illinois Institute of Technology, 2017 \u2013 2021", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1962, "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}]}, "42f0fa0bc989fc724c4333b4e83dfc726c1d8fa83862ca63695430421c97c390": {"nodes": [{"__data__": {"id_": "b3bde6a1-2186-4b8d-bdc7-0b65255256b2", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "D:\\LLM_Learning\\llamaindex_basics\\Files\\Reynolds_Alex.md", "file_name": "Reynolds_Alex.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 1892, "creation_date": "2026-09-08", "last_modified_date": "2026-09-08