t Tools:** Jira, TestRail, Confluence, DevTools\n  - **Databases:** Basic SQL (SELECT, JOIN, WHERE queries)\n  - **Operating Systems:** Windows, macOS, Android, iOS\n  - **Methodologies:** Agile/Scrum, Waterfall\n\n- **Project Experience:**\n  - Conducted testing for a personal project involving a web and mobile e-commerce app.\n  - Developed over 80 test cases and scenarios based on functional requirements.\n  - Performed cross-browser and cross-device testing.\n  - Logged and tracked over 25 bugs in Jira.\n  - Conducted API testing using Postman.\n\n- **Work History:**\n  - **Technical Support Specialist** at Apex Solutions Corp (Jan 2024 \u2013 Present)\n    - Provided troubleshooting assistance and created technical bug reports.\n    - Collaborated with QA team to verify bug fixes.\n\n- **Education & Certifications:**\n  - ISTQB Certified Tester Foundation Level (CTFL) \u2014 2024\n  - B.S. in Computer Science from the University of Texas at Austin (2020 \u2013 2024)", "excerpt_keywords": "Keywords: QA Tester, Manual Testing, Software Testing, ISTQB Certification, Project Experience"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "a5be4d06-7111-42ac-9312-6652b6aab772", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "D:\\LLM_Learning\\llamaindex_basics\\Files\\Reynolds_Alex.md", "file_name": "Reynolds_Alex.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 1892, "creation_date": "2026-09-08", "last_modified_date": "2026-09-08"}, "hash": "4f7a0e660ad262466602f3539d950e8b8e4ebac18d316ba4d394f8782d993887", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Junior QA Manual Tester\r\nALEX REYNOLDS\r\n\r\nJunior QA Manual Tester\r\n\r\nEmail: alex.reynolds@email.com | Phone: +1 (555) 019-2834 | Location: Austin, TX\r\n\r\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/alexreynolds-qa | GitHub: github.com/alexreynolds-qa\r\n\r\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\r\n\r\nDetail-oriented and adaptable Junior QA Tester with hands-on experience in manual testing of web and mobile applications. Skilled in designing test cases, executing functional/non-functional tests, and documenting software defects using Jira. Strong grasp of SDLC, STLC, and Agile methodologies. ISTQB Certified Foundation Level (CTFL).\r\n\r\nTECHNICAL SKILLS\r\n\r\nTesting Types: Functional, Regression, Smoke, Exploratory, Sanity, Usability, API (Postman)\r\n\r\nTest Management & Tools: Jira, TestRail, Confluence, DevTools\r\n\r\nDatabases: Basic SQL (SELECT, JOIN, WHERE queries)\r\n\r\nOS Platforms: Windows, macOS, Android, iOS\r\n\r\nMethodologies: Agile / Scrum, Waterfall\r\n\r\nPROJECT EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\nWeb & Mobile E-Commerce App Testing (Personal Project)\r\n\r\nDeveloped over 80 test cases and test scenarios based on functional requirements.\r\n\r\nPerformed cross-browser and cross-device testing across Chrome, Safari, iOS, and Android.\r\n\r\nLogged and tracked 25+ bugs in Jira with step-by-step reproduction steps, severity ratings, and screenshots.\r\n\r\nConducted API testing using Postman to verify HTTP response status codes and JSON payloads.\r\n\r\nWORK HISTORY\r\n\r\nTechnical Support Specialist | Apex Solutions Corp \u2014 Austin, TX | Jan 2024 \u2013 Present\r\n\r\nAssisted end-users with troubleshooting software issues, translating user problems into detailed technical bug reports for the engineering team.\r\n\r\nCollaborated with QA team members to verify fixed bugs prior to production release.\r\n\r\nEDUCATION & CERTIFICATIONS\r\n\r\nISTQB Certified Tester Foundation Level (CTFL) \u2014 2024\r\n\r\nB.S. in Computer Science \u2014 University of Texas at Austin, 2020 \u2013 2024", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1882, "text_template": "[Excerpt fro