t:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}]}, "f58b83d883716c94bfc69e0615fac6e433ee289330cff1d2c9880717e6ffcbf3": {"nodes": [{"__data__": {"id_": "090549fc-a6ee-4ca4-81ab-8a430633c75d", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "D:\\LLM_Learning\\llamaindex_basics\\Files\\Vance_Marcus.md", "file_name": "Vance_Marcus.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 2404, "creation_date": "2026-09-08", "last_modified_date": "2026-09-08", "document_title": "\"Comprehensive Profile of Marcus Vance: Senior Lead QA/SDET and Software QA Engineer Specializing in Test Automation, Cloud Solutions, and Team Leadership\"", "section_summary": "**Summary:**\n\nThe section provides a comprehensive profile of Marcus Vance, a Senior Lead QA/SDET and Software QA Engineer with over 8 years of experience in test automation and quality assurance. Key topics and entities include:\n\n- **Personal Information:**\n  - Name: Marcus Vance\n  - Email: marcus.vance@email.com\n  - Phone: +1 (555) 018-4452\n  - Location: Seattle, WA\n  - LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/marcusvance-sdet\n  - GitHub: github.com/mvance-sdet\n\n- **Professional Summary:**\n  - Expertise in designing scalable test architectures and leading QA teams.\n  - Proficient in TypeScript, Java, Playwright, Cypress, and AWS cloud environments.\n  - Experienced in implementing Shift-Left testing practices.\n\n- **Core Competencies:**\n  - Automation Frameworks: TypeScript, JavaScript, Java, Playwright, Cypress, Selenium, Appium.\n  - Performance & Load Testing: Locust, k6, JMeter.\n  - Cloud & DevOps: AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, GitLab CI/CD, Terraform.\n  - Leadership: Team mentorship, QA strategy, test metrics, and reporting.\n\n- **Work Experience:**\n  - **Current Position:** Senior Lead SDET / QA Manager at CloudScale Technologies (Jan 2022 \u2013 Present)\n    - Leading a team of 6 QA Engineers.\n    - Implemented a Playwright + TypeScript test framework for microservices.\n    - Reduced production defect rates by 35% through early contract testing.\n    - Designed performance test suites for high traffic validation.\n    - Established QA metrics for executive reporting.\n  \n  - **Previous Position:** Senior QA Automation Engineer at HealthTech Solutions (Aug 2018 \u2013 Dec 2021)\n    - Developed test automation solutions for HIPAA-compliant applications.\n    - Configured automated test execution in AWS using Docker.\n    - Mentored junior testers in programming and best practices. \n\nOverall, the profile highlights Marcus Vance's technical skills, leadership abilities, and significant contributions to quality assurance in software development.", "excerpt_keywords": "Keywords: QA Engineer, Test Automation, Cloud Solutions, Leadership, Performance Testing"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "b4bc7d74-ccbb-4548-a246-29cc85202134", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "D:\\LLM_Learning\\llamaindex_basics\\Files\\Vance_Marcus.md", "file_name": "Vance_Marcus.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 2404, "creation_date": "2026-09-08", "last_modified_date": "2026-09-08"}, "hash": "f169415dead0cd6dde8e24217160ef74cb7af2723fea96c394051e31247c647d", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "0a1ae1d1-0756-405b-a2ac-cf965970e7bb", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "463b7ee7138977f90c0d242c16d37de59ced0a705626f94f38cc117a97ee8ecf", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Senior Lead QA / SDET\r\nMARCUS VANCE\r\n\r\nSenior QA Lead / SDET\r\n\r\nEmail: marcus.vance@email.com | Phone: +1 (555) 018-4452 | Location: Seattle, WA\r\n\r\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/marcusvance-sdet | GitHub: github.com/mvance-sdet\r\n\r\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\r\n\r\nResults-driven Lead SDET with 8+ years of experience designing scalable test architecture, leading QA teams, and driving quality standards across enterprise microservice ecosystems. Expert in TypeScript/Java, Playwright, Cypress, and AWS cloud environments. Experienced in managing cross-functional QA teams, setting test strategies, and implementing Shift-Left testing practices.\r\n\r\nCORE COMPETENCIES\r\n\r\nAutomation Frameworks: TypeScript, JavaScript, Java, Playwright, Cypress, Selenium, Appium\r\n\r\nPerformance & Load: Locust, k6, JMeter\r\n\r\nCloud & DevOps: AWS (S3, ECS), Docker, Kubernetes, GitLab CI/CD, Terraform\r\n\r\nLeadership: Team Mentorship (5+ engineers), QA Strategy, Test Metrics & Reporting, Shift-Left QA\r\n\r\nWORK EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\nSenior Lead SDET / QA Manager | CloudScale Technologies \u2014 Seattle, WA | Jan 2022 \u2013 Present\r\n\r\nLed a team of 6 QA Engineers in architecting a modern Playwright + TypeScript test framework covering 12 microservices.\r\n\r\nShifted QA practices left by embedding contract testing (Pact) into early development cycles, reducing production defect rate by 35%.\r\n\r\nDesigned performance and stress test suites using k6 and Docker to validate peak traffic loads of up to 50,000 concurrent users.\r\n\r\nEstablished company-wide QA metrics (Defect Escape Rate, Test Coverage, Automation ROI) presented monthly to C-level executives.\r\n\r\nSenior QA Automation Engineer | HealthTech Solutions \u2014 Seattle, WA | Aug 2018 \u2013 Dec 2021\r\n\r\nDeveloped Java + Selenium BDD (Cucumber) test automation solution for HIPAA-compliant medical applications.\r\n\r\nConfigured scalable automated test execution in AWS cloud using Docker containers.\r\n\r\nMentored junior and mid-level testers in object-oriented programming, Page Object Model (POM), and Git best practices.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 2014, "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{met